Hi <%= @profile.name.split.first %>,

<% case @application.status -%>
<% when "shortlisted" -%>
<%= @company.display_name %> shortlisted you for <%= @job.title %>. Expect them to reach out about next steps.
<% when "hired" -%>
Congratulations! <%= @company.display_name %> marked you as hired for <%= @job.title %>. If you're no longer looking, update your availability so other companies know.
<% when "rejected" -%>
<%= @company.display_name %> decided not to move forward with your application for <%= @job.title %>. It's not the news you wanted, and it's no reflection on what you can do. Thanks for putting yourself forward.
<% else -%>
<%= @company.display_name %> started reviewing your application for <%= @job.title %>.
<% end -%>
<% if @message.present? -%>

A note from <%= @company.display_name %>:

<%= @message %>
<% end -%>

<% if @application.rejected? -%>
Browse open jobs: <%= @jobs_url %>
<% else -%>
View your application: <%= @application_url %>
<% end -%>
